  "details": "As of 26 May 2026, we are only able to make events with 2 layer of visibility.\n\n- Public\n\n- Group\n\nwe can only have 2 choice with no possibility to select one or multiples roles.\n\nThe idea to have a third level of visibility ( By Roles) it will added to the other layer with a option to select multiple roles.\n\nRight now i see many groups who make a second or multiple sub group or do a announcement using third-party platform (discord for example)\n\nThis feature would allow groups to create a event and select a third layer of visibility and select some specific roles\n\nSo adding role-based visibility would make the event system significantly more flexible and useful without requiring groups to create duplicate sub-groups.\n\nThen we can make private event without create a sub group and keep everything in the same group instead of relying other platform",
